              <AbstractNodeData Name="Text_17" ActionTag="1847923745" Tag="584" RotationSkewX="0" RotationSkewY="0" LeftMargin="93.582703" RightMargin="93.417297" TopMargin="162.944305" BottomMargin="417.055695" HorizontalEdge="LeftEdge" FontSize="34" LabelText="1.购买会员卡后可立即获得对应会员，并在会员卡时效内获
得对应权益。" IsCustomSize="True" OutlineSize="1" ShadowOffsetX="2" ShadowOffsetY="-2" ctype="TextObjectData">
                <Size Y="80" X="900" />
                <AnchorPoint ScaleX="0" ScaleY="0.5" />
                <Position X="93.582703" Y="457.055695" />
                <Scale ScaleX="1" ScaleY="1" />
                <CColor A="255" B="81" G="133" R="205" />
                <FontResource Type="Normal" Path="Common/Font/fangzhengcuyuan.TTF" Plist="" />
                <OutlineColor A="255" B="0" G="0" R="255" />
                <ShadowColor A="255" B="110" G="110" R="110" />
              </AbstractNodeData>
              <AbstractNodeData Name="Text_17_0" ActionTag="1487258630" Tag="585" RotationSkewX="0" RotationSkewY="0" LeftMargin="93.582703" RightMargin="93.417297" TopMargin="256.693909" BottomMargin="323.306091" FontSize="34" LabelText="2.每日领取福利需要在【会员权益】界面手动领取，未领取的福利次日失效。" IsCustomSize="True" OutlineSize="1" ShadowOffsetX="2" ShadowOffsetY="-2" ctype="TextObjectData">
                <Size Y="80" X="900" />
                <AnchorPoint ScaleX="0" ScaleY="0.5" />
                <Position X="93.582703" Y="363.306091" />
                <Scale ScaleX="1" ScaleY="1" />
                <CColor A="255" B="81" G="133" R="205" />
                <FontResource Type="Normal" Path="Common/Font/fangzhengcuyuan.TTF" Plist="" />
                <OutlineColor A="255" B="0" G="0" R="255" />
                <ShadowColor A="255" B="110" G="110" R="110" />
              </AbstractNodeData>
              <AbstractNodeData Name="Text_17_1" ActionTag="1410359519" Tag="586" RotationSkewX="0" RotationSkewY="0" LeftMargin="93.582703" RightMargin="268.417297" TopMargin="350.446503" BottomMargin="269.553497" FontSize="34" LabelText="3.不同种类的会员卡可同时购买，福利独立发放。" OutlineSize="1" ShadowOffsetX="2" ShadowOffsetY="-2" ctype="TextObjectData">
                <Size Y="40" X="725" />
                <AnchorPoint ScaleX="0" ScaleY="0.5" />
                <Position X="93.582703" Y="289.553497" />
                <Scale ScaleX="1" ScaleY="1" />
                <CColor A="255" B="81" G="133" R="205" />
                <FontResource Type="Normal" Path="Common/Font/fangzhengcuyuan.TTF" Plist="" />
                <OutlineColor A="255" B="0" G="0" R="255" />
                <ShadowColor A="255" B="110" G="110" R="110" />
              </AbstractNodeData>
              <AbstractNodeData Name="Text_17_2" ActionTag="478111108" Tag="587" RotationSkewX="0" RotationSkewY="0" LeftMargin="93.582703" RightMargin="302.417297" TopMargin="404.193695" BottomMargin="215.806305" FontSize="34" LabelText="4.续费或叠加购买同种会员卡，时效自动顺延。" OutlineSize="1" ShadowOffsetX="2" ShadowOffsetY="-2" ctype="TextObjectData">
                <Size Y="40" X="691" />
                <AnchorPoint ScaleX="0" ScaleY="0.5" />
                <Position X="93.582703" Y="235.806305" />
                <Scale ScaleX="1" ScaleY="1" />
                <CColor A="255" B="81" G="133" R="205" />
                <FontResource Type="Normal" Path="Common/Font/fangzhengcuyuan.TTF" Plist="" />
                <OutlineColor A="255" B="0" G="0" R="255" />
                <ShadowColor A="255" B="110" G="110" R="110" />
              </AbstractNodeData>
              <AbstractNodeData Name="Text_17_2_0" ActionTag="-828425251" Tag="34" RotationSkewX="0" RotationSkewY="0" LeftMargin="93.582703" RightMargin="93.417297" TopMargin="457.943695" BottomMargin="72.056297" FontSize="34" LabelText="5. 如在您会员卡生效期间，因运营策略调整等原因发生变更，您享受的会员权益在有效期内不会发生改变；如您在生效期间进行续费，续费后的会员卡将调整为新的会员权益。" IsCustomSize="True" OutlineSize="1" ShadowOffsetX="2" ShadowOffsetY="-2" ctype="TextObjectData">
                <Size Y="130" X="900" />
                <AnchorPoint ScaleX="0" ScaleY="0.5" />
                <Position X="93.582703" Y="137.056305" />
                <Scale ScaleX="1" ScaleY="1" />
                <CColor A="255" B="81" G="133" R="205" />
                <FontResource Type="Normal" Path="Common/Font/fangzhengcuyuan.TTF" Plist="" />
                <OutlineColor A="255" B="0" G="0" R="255" />
                <ShadowColor A="255" B="110" G="110" R="110" />
              </AbstractNodeData>
